<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>{{childName}} is enrolled at {{clubName}}</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #333;
      background-color: #f4f4f4;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 20px auto;
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    }
    .header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #059669 0%, #047857 100%);
      color: #fff;
      padding: 30px 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 30px 20px;
    }
    .details {
      background: #F0FDF4;
      border-left: 4px solid #059669;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 20px 0;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }
    .details h3 {
      margin: 0 0 10px 0;
      color: #047857;
      font-size: 16px;
    }
    .details table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
    }
    .details td {
      padding: 6px 0;
      vertical-align: top;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .details td.label {
      color: #6B7280;
      width: 40%;
    }
    .steps {
      margin: 20px 0;
      padding-left: 20px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .steps li {
      padding: 4px 0;
    }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #059669;
      color: #fff;
      padding: 14px 28px;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin: 20px 0;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 16px;
    }
    .footer {
      background: #F8FAFC;
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
      color: #64748B;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .footer p {
      margin: 5px 0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>{{childName}} has a place</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
      <p>Dear {{parentName}},</p>

      <p>That is confirmed. {{childName}} is now enrolled at {{clubName}}{{#if squadName}} in {{squadName}}{{/if}}.</p>

      <div class="details">
        <h3>What we have set up</h3>
        <table>
          <tr>
            <td class="label">{{memberNoun}} record</td>
            <td>Created, with a place on the register</td>
          </tr>
{{#if consentsRequested}}
          <tr>
            <td class="label">Consent forms</td>
            <td>{{consentsRequested}} waiting for you in the parent portal</td>
          </tr>
{{/if}}
          <tr>
            <td class="label">Fees</td>
            <td>{{#if mandateAlreadyActive}}Collected on your existing Direct Debit{{else}}A separate email explains how to set up your Direct Debit{{/if}}</td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </div>

{{#if inviteUrl}}
      <p>Set up your parent portal account with the link below. From there you can see the register, give consent, and keep contact and medical details up to date.</p>

      <div style="text-align: center;">
        <a href="{{inviteUrl}}" class="button">Set up your account</a>
      </div>

      <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #64748B;">This link is valid for 7 days. If it has expired by the time you use it, ask us for a new one.</p>
{{/if}}

      <p>We look forward to seeing {{childName}} in the gym.</p>

      <p style="margin-top: 20px;">
        Best wishes,<br>
        <strong>{{clubName}}</strong>
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <p>&copy; {{year}} {{clubName}}. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p>This is an automated email. Please do not reply to this message.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
